WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.435
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:03.469
We hope you're all doing well,

00:00:03.469 --> 00:00:04.704
and now we're going to
get to the news.

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:06.606
President Biden announced
yesterday

00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:08.041
that the U.S. is banning

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:10.843
all imports
of Russian gas and energy.

00:00:10.843 --> 00:00:13.646
And then, for emphasis,
he biked away.

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:15.548
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:18.417
House Democrats are set to
travel to Philadelphia tomorrow

00:00:18.417 --> 00:00:20.153
for their annual
three-day retreat,

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:22.922
and Biden's already
practicing his trust falls.

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:25.725
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:27.026
Dude!

00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:29.896
You're supposed to wait
for another person.

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.566
The United Nations
has reportedly instructed

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:35.168
its communications staff

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:39.004
not to describe the conflict in
Ukraine as a war or an invasion.

00:00:39.004 --> 00:00:41.007
How else would you describe it?

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:43.242
Oh, it's just
a little uninvited drop-in.

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:44.777
No worse than Urkel.

00:00:44.777 --> 00:00:46.412
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:49.715
Republican Senator Ted Cruz
claimed during a recent meeting

00:00:49.715 --> 00:00:52.885
that almost every time he flies,
the captain or flight attendant

00:00:52.885 --> 00:00:56.055
will hug him because he does not
support vaccine mandates.

00:00:56.055 --> 00:00:58.357
Are you sure
they're hugging you?

00:00:58.357 --> 00:01:00.392
They might be trying to
wrestle you off the plane

00:01:00.392 --> 00:01:02.495
and back to your job.

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:03.829
"Well, thank you very much."

00:01:03.829 --> 00:01:05.565
"We're not thanking you!"

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:07.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:09.402
President Biden told Americans
yesterday

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:11.337
to expect higher gasoline prices

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:13.239
amid the Russian invasion
of Ukraine

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:15.741
and called it
"Putin's price hike."

00:01:15.741 --> 00:01:17.177
Also, he has some bad news

00:01:17.177 --> 00:01:20.680
about Putin's
prescription drug prices.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.615
"Ah, I'm gonna try to
sneak that one in, too."

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:26.719
Republican Senator Susan Collins
met yesterday

00:01:26.719 --> 00:01:28.721
with President Biden's
Supreme Court nominee,

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:31.390
Judge Ketanji Brown Jackson,
for 90 minutes.

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:33.593
"After meeting with her,
I don't think she's qualified

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:35.962
for the position,"
said Judge Jackson.

00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:38.832
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.832 --> 00:01:41.333
Researchers at
the University of Georgia

00:01:41.333 --> 00:01:43.202
said last week
that the East Coast

00:01:43.202 --> 00:01:46.672
is set to be inundated this
spring by the joro spider,

00:01:46.672 --> 00:01:48.474
a large invasive species

00:01:48.474 --> 00:01:51.911
that uses its webs like
a parachute in order to fly.

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:55.248
Which brings us to
our new segment -- "Not Now."

00:01:55.248 --> 00:01:58.150
♪♪

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:02.154
Not now, joro spider!

00:02:02.154 --> 00:02:03.356
Read the room.

00:02:03.356 --> 00:02:05.558
We're still dealing
with a deadly pandemic,

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:08.494
a war in Ukraine, global
warming, and rampant crime.

00:02:08.494 --> 00:02:10.830
You can't even get swatted
with a newspaper

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.999
because we need the newspaper
to actually read

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:14.634
if it's safe to go outside.

00:02:15.734 --> 00:02:17.370
Not now!

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:19.939
Oh, you know the CDC isn't
going to be able to handle this.

00:02:19.939 --> 00:02:21.173
They'll announce
that we should all be

00:02:21.173 --> 00:02:23.276
stomping the joro spiders,
then two days later,

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:24.310
they'll be like, "Wait, wait!

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:25.811
No, stomping
just makes them mad!"

00:02:25.811 --> 00:02:27.480
Seriously.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:29.615
Please, not now.

00:02:29.615 --> 00:02:31.484
If we get infested
with spiders now,

00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:35.053
we can't even afford the gas
to burn our houses down.

00:02:35.053 --> 00:02:36.522
Not now, joro spiders!

00:02:36.522 --> 00:02:39.659
-This has been "Not Now."

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:42.095
-The athletic apparel
brand Lululemon yesterday

00:02:42.095 --> 00:02:43.696
unveiled
its first-ever running shoe.

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:46.432
The sneaker will give you the
grip and the support you need

00:02:46.432 --> 00:02:48.368
when you're demanding
to speak to a manager.

00:02:48.368 --> 00:02:53.506
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:56.776
Today was Donald Trump Jr.'s
fiancée, Kimberly Guilfoyle,

00:02:56.776 --> 00:02:58.143
53rd birthday.

00:02:58.143 --> 00:02:59.678
And don't worry about
getting her anything --

00:02:59.678 --> 00:03:01.714
she already has
what she deserves.

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:03.983
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.983 --> 00:03:07.987
Charles Entenmann of the famous
Entenmann's baked-good franchise

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:09.989
has died at the age of 92.

00:03:09.989 --> 00:03:12.358
Said moms,
"Ehh, should still be good."

00:03:12.358 --> 00:03:14.627
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.627 --> 00:03:17.429
Sorry, we have a...

00:03:17.429 --> 00:03:19.599
we have a brand-new writer
who thought that joke would --

00:03:19.599 --> 00:03:20.566
What's that?

00:03:20.566 --> 00:03:24.036
Oh, it was
head writer Alex Baze...

00:03:24.036 --> 00:03:26.839
who's been doing this longer
than anyone.

00:03:27.773 --> 00:03:29.041
"They're gonna love it!

00:03:29.041 --> 00:03:30.643
People love Entenmann's cake.

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:33.246
They'll love a joke
about how the guy died."

00:03:33.246 --> 00:03:35.414
[ Laughter ]

00:03:35.414 --> 00:03:36.849
Yet, I had to do it.
You know why?

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:37.750
'Cause I'm scared of him.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:41.854
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.888 --> 00:03:44.023
Oh!

00:03:44.023 --> 00:03:45.023
Okay, that's better.

00:03:45.023 --> 00:03:45.825
He's not really dead.

00:03:45.825 --> 00:03:47.026
He is? Oh, he is.

00:03:48.194 --> 00:03:49.762
A man in Georgia was recently --

00:03:49.762 --> 00:03:51.130
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:52.732
This is all --
Baze wrote that part, too.

00:03:54.266 --> 00:03:56.101
A man in Georgia
was recently sentenced

00:03:56.101 --> 00:03:57.403
to three years in prison

00:03:57.403 --> 00:03:59.739
for allegedly using part of
a coronavirus relief loan

00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:02.074
to buy a Pokémon trading card.

00:04:02.074 --> 00:04:04.911
Or, as he's telling
his cellmates, killing a guy.

00:04:04.911 --> 00:04:06.812
[ Laughter ]

00:04:06.812 --> 00:04:08.280
Amid retirement rumors,

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:10.115
Green Bay Packers quarterback
Aaron Rodgers

00:04:10.115 --> 00:04:12.385
has reportedly decided
to remain with the team

00:04:12.385 --> 00:04:14.520
for at least one more variant.

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:17.823
[ Laughter ]

00:04:17.823 --> 00:04:19.892
And finally,
according to a new poll,

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:21.627
39% of New Yorkers said that

00:04:21.627 --> 00:04:23.329
they're planning to
move out of the state.

00:04:23.329 --> 00:04:26.365
Said their friends,
"Uhh, I'm busy that weekend."

00:04:26.365 --> 00:04:29.736
And that, you guys,
was a monologue.

